  "text": "A: So, did you hear about the new caf\u00e9 downtown?\n\nB: No, really? I haven\u2019t been by there yet. What\u2019s the deal?\n\nA: It\u2019s supposed to be really good\u2014local roasted coffee, live music on the weekends.\n\nB: Oh, nice. I love live music. Do they have any specific acts coming up?\n\nA: I think they\u2019re booking a local indie band next Friday. I might go check it out.\n\nB: That sounds cool. I should probably make time to go. I haven\u2019t had a good coffee in ages.\n\nA: Yeah, the coffee there is amazing. It\u2019s like they grind it fresh every morning.\n\nB: Wow, that\u2019s pretty impressive. I hope they keep it up. I might have to go find a new favorite spot.\n\nA: Definitely. It\u2019s a great place to hang out, too. They have a little outdoor seating area.\n\nB: Oh, I like that. I hate being cooped up indoors all the time. Outdoor seating is a plus.\n\nA: Exactly. It\u2019s a nice change of pace. I think I\u2019ll bring my book and read there next time.\n\nB: That sounds like a plan. I\u2019ll bring my guitar and maybe even play a few songs.\n\nA: That would be awesome. I\u2019d love to hear you play.\n\nB: I\u2019d like that too. It\u2019s been a while since I played in front of people.\n\nA: No worries. It\u2019s always good to get back into it. Maybe I can come too and watch.\n\nB: You\u2019re on. Let\u2019s make it a thing. I\u2019ll even bring some snacks.\n\nA: Great. I can bring my book. It\u2019s a perfect combo.\n\nB: Perfect. I can\u2019t wait. Let\u2019s plan to meet there next Friday.\n\nA: Deal. See you then.",
